{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-6","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与整数","englishTitle":"If a number by multiplying itself make a cube number, it will itself also be cube.","book":9,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","contentId":"euclid-9-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5096031ee1f5cc5cc5136ba4960dafeed4960e68e901831b2579965eb776f4f6","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-6.statement","euclid-9-6.construction.1","euclid-9-6.construction.2","euclid-9-6.proof.1","euclid-9-6.proof.2","euclid-9-6.proof.3","euclid-9-6.proof.4","euclid-9-6.proof.5","euclid-9-6.proof.6","euclid-9-6.proof.7","euclid-9-6.proof.8","euclid-9-6.proof.9","euclid-9-6.proof.10","euclid-9-6.proof.11","euclid-9-6.proof.12","euclid-9-6.conclusion","euclid-9-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74e19a8a86230c02044dd5a56e19481cdcc097096a490c253b4bb5aead201f17","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number by multiplying itself make a cube number, it will itself also be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个乘以乘以自身算出 立方数 的数值,它本身也会是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71c381ecae01ba72cec37832c39664a353f3666dc6435ca7d89833dcd232b85d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number A by multiplying itself make the cube number B; I say that A is also cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A乘以乘以立方数 B,我说A也是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9fb7b76ebf77bf240640b3f0d5fde52c7f3b0535098c36c95a2d6a287d76ec57","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A by multiplying B make C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A和B的产物是C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e10fbbeb17ec14c85181e47242f34357a03c8d24d29c576fee75c1b2a993f736","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, A by multiplying itself has made B, and by multiplying B has made C, therefore C is cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,A乘以本身就形成B,B乘以C,因此C是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a57a5c11403b0d29100541ad39b89325469361c76b3d33d72412cce0c9f60d4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A by multiplying itself has made B, therefore A measures B according to the units in itself."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以乘以B, A 整除 B 依其本身。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2fa3f00b82fcb20ed6d7f1b22cfa8ef397e5fb5ba16b70afb6a8a5ed949c50a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit also measures A according to the units in it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位的计算 单位也是整除 A"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39beeac61d627c9c9b51d82d46d759c6cb8ab778bbdd52f7f225b73ffedd9e06","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the unit is to A, so is A to B. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位对A的比等于A对B的比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0737a79799855fe9b5aa8a5555598741c6862f71dde0befd08bad41fc46d78a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A by multiplying B has made C, therefore B measures C according to the units in A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以B C,B 整除 C,A"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2fa3f00b82fcb20ed6d7f1b22cfa8ef397e5fb5ba16b70afb6a8a5ed949c50a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit also measures A according to the units in it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位的计算 单位也是整除 A"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"939bcb899782ef2ec4b203dc29237c7f327a53cc5bb3f2830dc8241c154c2f18","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the unit is to A, so is B to C. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位对A的比等于B对C的比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea61bda97f42eafe1df0052ff257f96ad86db3a1b103bfdd1ad160eee458e61b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the unit is to A, so is A to B; therefore also, as A is to B, so is B to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,单位-A的比等于A-B的比;因此,A-B的比等于B-C的比；A 与 B 之比等于 B 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a794a0539628aa746e8a27ada20c873b5d8c3a5779c03e163d3639385f772aea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since B, C are cube, they are similar solid numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B,C是立方体,相似立体数是"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1f6518e251ab2bc08ecb1d101256a683496dfba3ba4068fb55353004ee7948e","citations":["euclid-8-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there are two mean proportional numbers between B, C. [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在B到C之间有2 比例中项个数字。 [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4f80d677c4e792112f3a07f2500f989cf612847bbca82e3ca093a1c7ed8ddcf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as B is to C, so is A to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B比C等于A比B；B 与 C 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf739f77dae4844032913ae4c85cd3257f1f52a35fe12b61d446b5801dc1dc56","citations":["euclid-8-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore there are two mean proportional numbers between A, B also. [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,还有2 比例中项个数字,在A和B之间。 [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"923fffd2c590ac6dfdf4eb5c4d8f2a409f53fa399e5f2ae422b89e1011fcdb7b","citations":["euclid-8-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And B is cube; therefore A is also cube. [cf. [VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B是立方体, 因此A也是立方体。 ] 证毕。 [cf. [VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-6.source","contentId":"euclid-9-6","revisionId":"euclid-9-6@raw-5096031ee1f5cc5c","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6e4511e0ac18a96f4e6b0023618a960e2bb8e5dc81526af2a5a3cdcebd66e0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-6:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-6.proof.4","euclid-9-6.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn